{"id":"00028","root":"uni00028_1","name":{"ja":"ナディア","en":"Nadia"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ナディア","en":"Nadia"},"element":"Natural","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":28,"profile":{"ja":"魔界の支配階級で魔人に属している。強力な魔力と力などを駆使すれば、魔界を牛耳れる力を有している。同じ支配階級であるメイア・ブラッドロードからは慕われている。エドウィン・ブラックやイングリッドからは嫌われているがその踊りの美しさは称賛され、魔界の踊り子の異名を持つ。彼女自身の魔力を踊りに上乗せさせることに見ている相手などに治癒や気力などの力を湧き上がらせる効果がある。だが、本当に恐ろしいのはその踊り以外のもう一つの踊りであるがその踊りは彼女自身が封印している。自分を慕ってくれているメイアが人間界で消息を絶ったことを聞かされ、彼女を捜索するために動き出す。護身用にククリナイフを持たされており、その武器は血を吸う度に切れ味が強化されるが、彼女はその武器を使ったことが無い。","en":"Nadia belongs to the ruling class of the Demon Realm and is a demon-person. By wielding her immense magical power and strength, she possesses the ability to dominate the Demon Realm. She is admired by her fellow aristocrat Meia Brandford, while Edwin Black and Ingrid dislike her, though they praise the beauty of her dance, earning her the nickname \"Demon Realm Dancer.\" By infusing her own magic into her performances, she can inspire observers with healing and vigor. Yet a far more terrifying dance exists—one she has sealed away herself. Upon learning that Meia, who cherishes her, has vanished in the Human Realm, Nadia sets out to find her. For self-defense she carries a kukri knife that sharpens with each drop of blood it draws, though she has never actually used it."},"illustrator":"さくらんぼ","voiceActor":"手塚りょうこ","forms":[{"id":"uni00028_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1030,2060],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[114,228],"def":[133,266],"spd":[45,45],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["4","75"]},{"id":"uni00028_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1560,3120],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[163,326],"def":[201,403],"spd":[45,45],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["4","75","76"]},{"id":"uni00028_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2090,4180],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[217,435],"def":[274,549],"spd":[45,4